+/**
+ * OpenBot Local: Antigravity 1.4.5 builds a cold session's agent on `AGY_ACP_DEFAULT_MODEL`
+ * (`gemini-3.8-flash-high` when unset), and a model or effort set after that rebuilds the agent, its
+ * `localharness_external` and its MCP servers at the start of the first prompt
+ * (`_maybe_apply_model_switch`). The id is `<model>-<level>`; an id the account does not offer
+ * falls back to the account's default, as an unset one does.
